p"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [-2467.693115234375, -1009.480224609375], "widgets_values": ["媳妇儿，你别瞪着眼跟审贼样中不中？我那点私房钱，真没乱花！前儿个见你逛街盯着那红围巾看半天，没舍得买，我就想偷偷攒俩钱，等你生日给你个惊喜。\n藏鞋盒里是怕你收拾衣裳看着，塞米缸底下是觉得你总说米面油得省着用，肯定不会常翻。谁知道你今个蒸米，手一掏给摸出来了！\n我真没藏多少，就跟你买化妆品剩那零头差不多，你别气了中不？晚上我给你擀捞面，再卧俩荷包蛋，放你爱吃的荆芥，咱不吵了行不？"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 8, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "输入你最后要生成的话", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [396.5276794433594, 193.39329528808594], "pos": [-997.8424682617188, -1058.87060546875], "widgets_values": ["audio/VoxCPM"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 10, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "label": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filename_prefix"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.52", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"filename_prefix": true, "audioUI": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["# ComfyUI-VoxCPM\n\n**VoxCPM**  a novel tokenizer-free TTS system for context-aware speech generation and true-to-life voice cloning.\n\n## Models\nThis node automatically downloads the required model files.\n\n| Model | Parameters | Hugging Face Link |\n|:---|:---:|:---|\n| VoxCPM-0.5B | 0.5B | [openbmb/VoxCPM-0.5B](https://huggingface.co/openbmb/VoxCPM-0.5B) |\n\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [323.6703796386719, 220.93923950195312], "pos": [-1940.4381103515625, -392.1839904785156], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## 🎤 实现高质量的语音克隆\n\n要获得最佳的语音克隆效果，提供准确的`prompt_text`（提示文本）至关重要。该文本作为一份转录文本，能将`prompt_audio`（提示音频）的声音与所说的话语对齐，从而让模型学习说话者独特的声音特征。\n\n### 如何有效使用`prompt_text`\n\n#### 1. **提供逐字转录文本**\n`prompt_text`必须是`prompt_audio`的逐字转录内容。不要对音频进行总结或描述。\n\n✅ **正确示例：** `那只敏捷的棕色狐狸跳过了那只懒狗。`\n\n❌ **错误示例：** `一个人在说一句关于狐狸的话。`\n\n#### 2. **标点符号很重要**\n使用准确的标点符号来捕捉说话者的语调。模型会学习说话者如何结束句子、提出问题或表现出兴奋情绪。\n\n- **陈述句：** `这是一个很好的例子。`\n- **疑问句：** `这是一个很好的例子吗？`\n- **表达兴奋：** `这是一个非常好的例子！`\n\n#### 3. **匹配音频和文本长度**\n音频片段的长度应足以捕捉说话者自然的语速和节奏。\n\n👍 **理想情况：** 一段5-15秒的连续、清晰的语音片段。\n\n👌 **尚可接受：** 一段3-5秒的片段。\n\n⚠️ **警告：** 极短的片段（少于3秒）可能会导致克隆出的声音稳定性较差或带有机器人感。\n\n\n> **注意：**\n> 为获得最佳效果，请使用清晰、高质量的`prompt_audio`，且背景噪音、混响或音乐应尽可能少。模型会尝试克隆整个声学环境，而不仅仅是声音。\n\nhttps://www.meixiaosan.com/tosound.html?voice_id=443"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [374.4948425292969, 704.2460327148438], "pos": [-2473.971435546875, -678.7312622070312], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["微信登录免费生成多语言的网址,暂时不key收费\nhttps://www.meixiaosan.com/tosound.html?voice_id=443"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "生成方言的网站-暂时可用", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [366.9421081542969, 88], "pos": [-1944.7042236328125, -1238.210205078125], "id": 11, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 5}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.26.11", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [2903.0853056669694, 1372.984966496075], "scale": 1.4122927695244558}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "参考的地方音频和文字", "bounding": [-1950.0003662109375, -1139.594604492